.TH "inconsistency-by-hymy" "6" "2026-11-13" "Inconsistency User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
inconsistency-by-hymy - the command to run Inconsistency.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
inconsistency-by-hymy [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Inconsistency is a 1k intro released by Hymy in August 2013 at Assembly
2013 (11th in the PC 1k compo).
.PP
The program is a shell script that contains the gzipped 32-bit ELF
executable of the intro: at each start, it is extracted into a temporary
directory, which is removed when the intro ends.
The intro uses SDL 1.2 and renders the picture in software, in a
1280x720 window.
.PP
The intro lasts about one minute.
Press Escape or close the window to quit.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
There are no options.
.SH INFOS
.PP
